ange bands set in proportion to the bow bands, as Sec. 722 directs.</p>", "source": "EPT 1975 Sec. 910-920", "cost": 3, "weight": 0, "quantity": 1, "category": "missile", "material": "chlen", "die": "d6", "damagePlus": 0, "magic": 0, "minStr": 0, "twoHanded": false, "noShield": false, "edged": false, "extraBlow": false, "everyOtherRound": false, "range": {"close": 50, "medium": 225, "long": 300}, "fixedDamage": "", "equipped": false, "lengthGroup": 0}, "effects": [], "folder": null, "sort": 17, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_key": "!items!JOOJVzfGZYBtSkR9"}, {"_id": "DimcDjVj1QgWpbge", "name": "Staff-sling", "type": "weapon", "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg", "system": {"description": "<p>Range 550-600 ft in the text; 600 used. Damage as for the Sling. Range bands set in proportion to the bow bands, as Sec. 722 directs.</p>", "source": "EPT 1975 Sec. 910-920", "cost": 8, "weight": 0, "quantity": 1, "category": "missile", "material": "chlen", "die": "d6", "damagePlus": 0, "magic": 0, "minStr": 0, "twoHanded": false, "noShield": false, "edged": false, "extraBlow": false, "everyOtherRound": false, "range": {"close": 100, "medium": 450, "long": 600}, "fixedDamage": "", "equipped": false, "lengthGroup": 0}, "effects": [], "folder": null, "sort": 18, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_key": "!items!DimcDjVj1QgWpbge"}, {"_id": "noC2ugIQJf35WVKL", "name": "Bolas", "type": "weapon", "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg", "system": {"description": "<p>Thrown up to about 120 ft to wrap and bring down a foe. Damage is not given separately; adjust to taste. Range bands set in proportion to the bow bands, as Sec. 722 directs.</p>", "source": "EPT 1975 Sec. 910-920", "cost": 2, "weight": 0, "quantity": 1, "category": "thrown", "material": "chlen", "die": "d6", "damagePlus": 0, "magic": 0, "minStr": 0, "twoHanded": false, "noShield": false, "edged": false, "extraBlow": false, "everyOtherRound": false, "range": {"close": 20, "medium": 90, "long": 120}, "fixedDamage": "", "equipped": false, "lengthGroup": 0}, "effects": [], "folder": null, "sort": 19, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_key": "!items!noC2ugIQJf35WVKL"}, {"_id": "opO71YWZwu4LI3Gg", "name": "Ballista", "type": "weapon", "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg", "system": {"description": "<p>5d6 on a hit; 1d6 men in a column may be spitted. Only +3 magical armour stops it (still 1d6). No hit bonuses with siege engines.</p>", "source": "EPT 1975 Sec. 910-920", "cost": 400, "weight": 0, "quantity": 1, "category": "siege", "material": "chlen", "die": "d6", "damagePlus": 0, "magic": 0, "minStr": 0, "twoHanded": false, "noShield": false, "edged": true, "extraBlow": false, "everyOtherRound": true, "range": {"close": 400, "medium": 850, "long": 1200}, "fixedDamage": "5d6", "equipped": false, "lengthGroup": 0}, "effects": [], "folder": null, "sort": 20, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_key": "!items!opO71YWZwu4LI3Gg"}, {"_id": "JAofOOuTB4h5XrDn", "name": "Sword (iron or steel)", "type": "weapon", "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg", "system": {"description": "<p>The 1975 encumbrance table gives this steel weight but the price list has no price: metal arms are rare and sold only now and then at armourers in the foreigners' quarter (Sec. 910). Set the price with the referee.</p>", "source": "EPT 1975 Sec. 910-920", "cost": 0, "weight": 900, "quantity": 1, "category": "melee", "material": "steel", "die": "d6", "damagePlus": 0, "magic": 0, "minStr": 0, "twoHanded": false, "noShield": false, "edged": true, "extraBlow": false, "everyOtherRound": false, "range": {"close": 0, "medium": 0, "long": 0}, "fixedDamage": "", "equipped": false, "lengthGroup": 7}, "effects": [], "folder": null, "sort": 21, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_key": "!items!JAofOOuTB4h5XrDn"}, {"_id": "5zgZLvboBmc9iCup", "name": "Dagger (iron or steel)", "type": "weapon", "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg", "system": {"description": "<p>Can be thrown about 100 ft; a thrown dagger gets no damage bonuses (Sec. 730